      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18032/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together oregano, salt, and pepper in a small bowl. Rub spice mixture all over chicken breasts. Melt butter in a skillet over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mbf7bY2MvxHis7ZJamQztkGKr68=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18032-slow-cooker-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-02-5760bcd1cfb34b54b6ff339f77b9e943.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18032/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook chicken in butter until lightly browned, 3 to 5 minutes per side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6AoMrrrN6lcM0APefvavMfP4m_Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18032-slow-cooker-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-03-9fc18123cf854df58ac2fe1fed8ae9e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18032/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chicken in a slow cooker.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PFi6QHhiLzjwLKV8xQz9W_jJWV4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18032-slow-cooker-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-04-ee3a2b36d5cf4668948acd3fafc00e77.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18032/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix water, lemon juice, garlic, and bouillon in the same skillet; bring to boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IJSFRLOqYoq05xmTXtckVK1uKk0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18032-slow-cooker-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-05-cbb5c1c68c6940ff9d67ef2be50ce25f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18032/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture over chicken in the slow cooker.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sb0-eHGxxWN_czgD83UrlbdtpoA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18032-slow-cooker-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-06-4b46123b116d4395ac3806c6a8588afb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18032/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and cook on Low for 6 hours or High for 3 hours. Add parsley to the slow cooker 15 to 30 minutes before the end of cook time.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hBj8827Z5YJQ4nnuoV7sOq3BsDc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18032-slow-cooker-lemon-garlic-chicken-VAT-step-07-f689dcb92df94cc9a98f0d54f3d7e208.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18032/step_07.webp"
